        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, where we provide an interconnected voice over Internet protocol (“VoIP”) service, the FCC applies many, but not all, of the same regulatory requirements to interconnected VoIP services as it does to common carrier telecommunications services.",
