        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Narrowband Satellite Services: Since our initial migration to narrowband satellite connectivity in the early 2000s, we continue to provide narrowband satellite services to customers in North America and internationally.",
