        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similar to our provision of services for our business aviation customers, we offer a full range of satellite connectivity options for voice, data, and video applications on land, at sea, and in the air for our global military/government customers.",
