        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also invest in various professional development and leadership training initiatives and conduct periodic forums relevant to our business that provide unique learning and networking opportunities across all business functions.",
